    {
      "subId": "7181719",
      "subQuestName": "与江雪对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172401": {
            "id": "718172401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "霄灯？怎么突然…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172402"
            ]
          },
          "718172402": {
            "id": "718172402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "是言笑拜托我送给你的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172403"
            ]
          },
          "718172403": {
            "id": "718172403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "那个厨子也是心思细腻，和我刚认识他的时候…已经完全不一样了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172404"
            ]
          },
          "718172404": {
            "id": "718172404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "时光荏苒，我却还是这副拿不起，放不下的模样，真是惭愧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172405"
            ]
          },
          "718172405": {
            "id": "718172405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "放不下什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172406"
            ]
          },
          "718172406": {
            "id": "718172406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "没事，一些琐事，不提也罢。有劳你跑这一趟，还送了我这盏霄灯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172407"
            ]
          },
          "718172407": {
            "id": "718172407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "虽然我没有什么想许的心愿，也很多年不放霄灯了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172408"
            ]
          },
          "718172408": {
            "id": "718172408",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "但有一盏霄灯在身边，看看也是好的，多谢你了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181721",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏言笑白天闲置对话判断$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718170101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718170101": {
            "id": "718170101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "这下糟糕了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170102"
            ]
          },
          "718170102": {
            "id": "718170102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170103"
            ]
          },
          "718170103": {
            "id": "718170103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "海灯节啊，客栈里一堆人回去过节了，干活的人少了一堆，忙得要命。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170104"
            ]
          },
          "718170104": {
            "id": "718170104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "现在我没闲功夫跟你说话，得赶紧准备着，等晚上客人都来点菜了，我估计水都赶不上喝。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170105"
            ]
          },
          "718170105": {
            "id": "718170105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你既然这么热心来关心我，那干脆晚上来帮忙吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170106"
            ]
          },
          "718170106": {
            "id": "718170106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "唉，能抓一个帮工是一个，毓华跑哪儿去了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181722",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏判断晚上19-23点$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181704",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718170401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718170401": {
            "id": "718170401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "哎哟，都给我忙忘了，楼下那桌客人的菜还没点。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170402"
            ]
          },
          "718170402": {
            "id": "718170402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "这样吧，你来给楼下两个外国客人那桌点单，就是荷尔德林和卡斯帕那桌。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170403"
            ]
          },
          "718170403": {
            "id": "718170403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "他们应该已经等了好一会儿了，可能有些等烦了，你记得先给他们上<color=#00E1FFFF>两份</color>小菜，<color=#00E1FFFF>美味的野菇鸡肉串</color>就好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170404"
            ]
          },
          "718170404": {
            "id": "718170404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "上完小菜之后再问问他们想吃些什么主菜，免得再跑一趟。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718170405"
            ]
          },
          "718170405": {
            "id": "718170405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "快去吧，别让客人等急了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181705",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718170501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718170501": {
            "id": "718170501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "荷尔德林",
            "text": "等了半天，怎么没人来招呼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181712",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718171201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718171201": {
            "id": "718171201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "金丝虾球。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718171202"
            ]
          },
          "718171202": {
            "id": "718171202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "好，我知道了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181715",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718171501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718171501": {
            "id": "718171501",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "乔姨",
            "text": "有什么事吗年轻人？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181717",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718171701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718171701": {
            "id": "718171701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "茱萸",
            "text": "青莲，除了金丝虾球，你还有什么想吃的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718171702"
            ]
          },
          "718171702": {
            "id": "718171702",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "青莲",
            "text": "咳咳，没事的，再等等好了，外送订单应该快来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718171703"
            ]
          },
          "718171703": {
            "id": "718171703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "茱萸",
            "text": "嗯？你有什么事吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181719",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718171901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718171901": {
            "id": "718171901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你的手脚还真是麻利，不愧是冒险家啊…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181721",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172101": {
            "id": "718172101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "这个吃白食的今天是怎么了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181723",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172301": {
            "id": "718172301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "又是一年海灯节…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181725",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172501": {
            "id": "718172501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "毓华那丫头怎么还不上来厨房帮忙…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181726",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172601": {
            "id": "718172601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "订单外送、购置食材、出餐…还有什么事来着…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181727",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172701": {
            "id": "718172701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "荷尔德林",
            "text": "希望上菜能够快点啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718172702"
            ]
          },
          "718172702": {
            "id": "718172702",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "卡斯帕",
            "text": "不知道会上什么菜呢…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181728",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172801": {
            "id": "718172801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "乔姨",
            "text": "谢谢你了啊，年轻人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181729",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718172901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718172901": {
            "id": "718172901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "茱萸",
            "text": "谢谢你专门跑这一趟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181730",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718173001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718173001": {
            "id": "718173001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "奇怪，怎么刚才把菜送下去之后，客人不是很满意的样子",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718173002"
            ]
          },
          "718173002": {
            "id": "718173002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "难道是我手艺不行了？不会吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718173003"
            ]
          },
          "718173003": {
            "id": "718173003",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "那么，其他事情都办妥了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718173004"
            ]
          },
          "718173004": {
            "id": "718173004",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "餐已经送到。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "718173005"
            ]
          },
          "718173005": {
            "id": "718173005",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "不错不错，那食材也买好了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181731",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718173101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718173101": {
            "id": "718173101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "唔…你这还是慢了点，唉，这事情确实是太多了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7181733",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "718173301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "718173301": {
            "id": "718173301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "晚上再来吧，我现在得抓紧时间做准备…"
          }
        }
      }
